abstract: >-
  C17 enumeration and retained-data validation for squares whose second
  arithmetic derivative is square. The canonical tables contain 9114
  consecutive terms through input root 10000000000, with documentary
  derivative chains, historical sealed records and exact source provenance.
  Finite analysis certifies 35 observed reduced-core/rate classes. The next
  sequence index remains unresolved; bounded independent checks are distinct
  from a second complete enumeration of the final interval.
